        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Fraud risk assessment - Why does financial crime occur?</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 700px;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #0d2a5c;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  h2.subtitle {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    color: #6b7d1e;\n    margin: 2px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  hr.underline {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 2px solid #29ABE2;\n    width: 230px;\n    margin: 6px 0 15px 0;\n  }\n  .layout {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .left-text {\n    width: 190px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .center-area {\n    flex: 1;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .top-boxes {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .box {\n    border: 1.5px solid;\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  .box-transactional {\n    border-color: #8DC63F;\n    width: 240px;\n  }\n  .box-fractured {\n    border-color: #29ABE2;\n    width: 240px;\n  }\n  .box h3 {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 0;\n    color: #111;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .box ul {\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n  }\n  .box ul:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .box li { margin-bottom: 4px; }\n\n  .triangle-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n  }\n  .triangle-wrap svg {\n    width: 480px;\n    height: 340px;\n  }\n  .tri-label {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    fill: #ffffff;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .box-systemic {\n    border: 1.5px solid #0d2a5c;\n    width: 430px;\n    margin: 0 0 0 auto;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .box-systemic h3 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 2px 0 8px 0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .box-systemic ul {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n  }\n  .box-systemic li { margin-bottom: 3px; }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    left: 30px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .footer-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    right: 30px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #29ABE2;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">Fraud risk assessment</h1>\n  <h2 class=\"subtitle\">Why does financial crime occur?</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"layout\">\n    <div class=\"left-text\">\n      <hr class=\"underline\">\n      At scale, financial crime WILL occur with statistical regularity if the right combination of elements are present.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"center-area\">\n      <div class=\"top-boxes\">\n        <div class=\"box box-transactional\">\n          <h3>TRANSACTIONAL</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Expectations to meet (financial) targets</li>\n            <li>Hide failing projects or contracts</li>\n            <li>Need for new financing</li>\n          </ul>\n          <h3>PERSONAL</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Financial problems</li>\n            <li>Extravagant life style</li>\n            <li>Addictions (drug or gambling habits)</li>\n            <li>Greed or revenge</li>\n            <li>Character flaws (i.e. sociopathic disorder)</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"box box-fractured\">\n          <h3>FRACTURED LOGIC...</h3>\n          <ul>\n            <li>&ldquo;My performance isn&rsquo;t recognized&rdquo;</li>\n            <li>&ldquo;Management doesn&rsquo;t care&rdquo;</li>\n            <li>&ldquo;Everyone else is does it&rdquo;</li>\n            <li>&ldquo;I&rsquo;m only borrowing&rdquo;</li>\n            <li>&ldquo;It&rsquo;s the cost of doing business&rdquo;</li>\n            <li>&ldquo;I have been mistreated and deserve compensation&rdquo;</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"triangle-wrap\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <!-- triangle vertices: Top=(300,10) Left=(40,350) Right=(560,350) Centroid=(300,236.7) -->\n          <polygon points=\"300,10 40,350 300,236.7\" fill=\"#8DC63F\" />\n          <polygon points=\"300,10 560,350 300,236.7\" fill=\"#29ABE2\" />\n          <polygon points=\"40,350 560,350 300,236.7\" fill=\"#0d2a5c\" />\n\n          <text class=\"tri-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" transform=\"translate(150,220) rotate(-58)\">Incentives</text>\n          <text class=\"tri-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" transform=\"translate(370,80) rotate(58)\">Rationalisation</text>\n          <text class=\"tri-label\" x=\"300\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"34\">Opportunity</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"box-systemic\">\n        <h3>SYSTEMIC WEAKNESSES</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Lack of oversight</li>\n          <li>Conflict</li>\n          <li>Implementation of new accounting software</li>\n          <li>High volume transactions (easy hiding)</li>\n          <li>New &amp; complex products</li>\n          <li>Grey areas in the rules</li>\n          <li>Ineffective internal controls</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">15</div>\n  <div class=\"footer-right\">&copy; 2014 Deloitte The Netherlands</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
